  "goodToKnow": "Textil means textile: textile Fasern, die Textilindustrie. Die Textilien (plural) are textiles and clothing. Textilfrei, jokingly, means nude: textilfreie Strände for FKK (Freikörperkultur), a long tradition in Germany. Since 2025, EU countries must collect used textiles separately. The adjective is often replaced by compounds: Textilfabrik, Textilwaren."
